  000463C              *  START COPYBOOK MEMBER IP600011 - EVENT LOG WORK AREA          *00011000
  000464C              *   DESCRIPTION: THIS IS THE EVENT LOG WORK AREA.  IT IS USED    *00012000
  000465C              *                TO RECORD THE LAST 500 EVENTS THAT OCCURRED     *00013000
  000466C              *                DURING A PRE-EDIT RUN.                           00014000
  000467C              *    THIS IS THE EVENT LOG WORK AREA.  IT WILL HOLD THE PROGRAM  *00015000
  000468C              *    AND PARAGRAPH NAMES AS THEY ARE EXECUTED.                   *00016000
  000469C              *    WHEN ADDING ENTRIES TO THE TABLE, INCREMENT THE INDEX,      *00017000
  000470C              *    AND WRITE THE CURRENT PROGRAM AND PARAGRAPH NAME.           *00018000
  000471C              *    WHEN THE LIMIT OF 500 ENTRIES IS REACHED, RESET THE INDEX   *00019000
  000472C              *    TO ONE, AND START ADDING ENTRIES AGAIN.                     *00020000
  000473C              *    COPYBOOK IP601011 CONTAINS THE PROCEDURE DIVISION CODE      *00030000
  000474C              *    FOR UPDATING THE EVENT LOG.                                 *00040000
  000475C              ******************************************************************00050000
